Scope of this license

This MIT license covers the code written for TropicaliaCraft Launcher: the
`tropicalia-launcher/` app, the scripts in `scripts/` and `tools/*.py|*.ps1`,
`tools/horizon-patches/` and `tropicalia-launcher-lab/`.

The vendored projects under `tools/` keep their own licenses, and our changes
to them are released under the same license as the file they modify:

  tools/pojav-android/           GNU LGPL-3.0  (PojavLauncher, MojoLauncher)
  tools/pojav-android/glfw/      zlib          (GLFW, MojoLauncher fork)
  tools/pojav-android/sdl/       zlib          (SDL, MojoLauncher fork)
  tools/pojav-android/mojoexec/  MIT           (mojoexec)
  tools/horizon-desktop/         MIT           (Horizon)
  tools/horizon-android/         MIT           (Horizon Android)

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the full list, authors and license texts.
